Description: Yu OS — graphical desktop environment
 Installs the Root-managed Hyprland compositor, authenticated greetd login
 and graphical Agent. Includes the OS-owned Desktop Shell with Quickshell,
 Caelestia and their private runtime. All other Yu OS Apps are installed
 as independently maintained packages.
